      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "it would also help dealing with annoying people. something like a small privacy bubble for hearing people that are very close to you since if you look at how people talk, they almost sit on each other or they are face to face. im also confused when there is more than one group of people talking in small area. i dont want to mute and unmute those people all the time. \nyou could even add the info under nameplate that someone have hearing distance adjusted so people can see from where they can speak to them.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-09-23T06:17:48.126Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I already been in a lot of small rooms with my Index VR and a thing I have noticed is, that I get confused by a lot of people talking in a small room everytime with the Index headphones. I would like to have some kind of slider to change the distance from where you can hear people",
